  {
   "key": "0x03",
   "name": "flags",
   "access": "write",
   "regions": [
    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
     "lines": "216-221"
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "Register 3 is the voice's flag word: bit 15 marks it busy, and bits 14 and 13 request key on and key off at register 0x202.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.h",
       "lines": "52-54",
       "sha": "70bf642c33fccb14ebfb5a9fc70a9c37b6e80cdd4f86672e393e27992f0bd141"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "209",
       "sha": "12d3fbee39dc87ca28cb799b548b735c82448a455418df9921eb47205fce18b2"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "132",
       "sha": "0682b2a559b811a0114cad18e994a324fd2ddf62dfe7f4d8289f1fda5e8507ce"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "234",
       "sha": "5fce06d505c3e03ba90760ef8247cd11a49b384d149998d9c3c149a0558be5d2"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "251",
       "sha": "1d0bb1d7846b73d5f81afccf6036b73d4fc514e920c00117680c9e8b7d746302"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "227",
       "sha": "b8b7fe149781ffd723aff2337310d3c1ee26be98229da9b120ad1fc64675062e"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "Bits 12, 11 and 10 are named loop trigger, loop history and frequency modulation; the stream raises loop history when it takes a loop.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.h",
       "lines": "55-57",
       "sha": "391107c45b90f52919753a63052825c4a19adcd96a9b246fede951194624b04f"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "90-99",
       "sha": "c8e8f9cea7439622c6774449d8322d05018256a3242fa09178817166b5d375dd"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "121",
       "sha": "8a3828759c839cbf60d51b5c320aa5cf2863fc42b8405a6e4dbfe7233dd27f31"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "138",
       "sha": "e36cbf60424597f542064cce93345fa93cb71f1fb0b00b9fbfbf348a9e40ff44"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "Bits 9 to 7 invert the phase of the rear-left, front-left and right outputs.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.h",
       "lines": "58-60",
       "sha": "1b5153fe5dd45df0b3329aa67a1fa548b18b83d72baacccbfba375f9a58909de"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "159-160",
       "sha": "067e23e7ea393ff7285052f02e785a0f7430c2352a5143c746d7ac9b4fc8a86c"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "163-164",
       "sha": "38cf51b43f3f1c987e9804d92bd47df4f06bcb1ad6a5072b1b831c869164dbf9"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "Bits 6 to 0 name the loop direction, link, noise, mu-law, the filter bypass, loop and reverse; value 3 is also named loop backwards.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.h",
       "lines": "61-68",
       "sha": "b345b70e5cffbdfcdaf04c07fc631f33b605925a890950603fdc6f5c513caf43"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "5",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "With the noise bit set the voice outputs a word from a shift register instead of a sample byte.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.h",
       "lines": "63",
       "sha": "ea505c52ec3f85dbc8a8e5c3d2b9dff4af7e532455a214e413685b8dc67dbc86"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "61-65",
       "sha": "0af1aa9580a6918916aad9cc746cf56ac78b782fa9cd04d9e7ed83a7a6c89ab6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "6",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "With the mu-law bit set each sample byte addresses a 256-entry table the device builds at start.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.h",
       "lines": "64",
       "sha": "7b23328c47035448cc4c19eb776ee34362f82ba300cc37a481916b72d48fd0c4"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "70-73",
       "sha": "302bd74e62663f6766de52ec8c3548fbdb203b560055bd0e00d7133ec85cd269"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "357-367",
       "sha": "13b757d729737dc79c25dd386a246ea7165f332f20ee1e1a20056ad7f21c7691"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "379-380",
       "sha": "1cb7416aa70a60096cd146906132f31ac75cdf74270942464d7638143ede0899"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "7",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "With the filter bit clear the output is interpolated between the last and the current sample by the counter's low bits.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.h",
       "lines": "65",
       "sha": "4ad47b665089b71264ecb000ed849be6add7e7797103c602f824d04aa87a9dd4"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "149",
       "sha": "2b1ca386afd234fb1bf4b68fbefb946b53c34c100c25da11626001a77a1531d0"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "154-155",
       "sha": "1cd29e22605c9cdd73fd32022771a8f602e293748d183626a83b4e2a0e098200"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "8",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "At wave_end, with loop and link and the reverse bit clear, a voice takes its new position from registers 5 and 7.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "77",
       "sha": "14b8bb67853188337066edf4f41c032d97c8f63e0be1689ebd71cc747fac97ca"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "88-94",
       "sha": "c8ee86e79075faa120daa5e2f4dc74a6408f8f7da756be6b5807fd70096348c9"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "211",
       "sha": "06b16fd4a8861af9798453c54769fcd54d1d3ea7811eb04d829be828db24f541"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "213",
       "sha": "f15fee253191919d377326fdba5babb1677bd32bfd29cac139d10aa9c96fb673"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "9",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "At wave_end, with loop alone and the reverse bit clear, a voice keeps the bank and takes register 7.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "77",
       "sha": "14b8bb67853188337066edf4f41c032d97c8f63e0be1689ebd71cc747fac97ca"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "88-99",
       "sha": "b1811ce8c1a803631d0676d361934890420905891667091caa37e966b2c5322d"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "236",
       "sha": "e14ce0e653c39cdb5a2d8a0c4644510e2aef4f3c50bec93a0826f52b3d6c24b1"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "213",
       "sha": "f15fee253191919d377326fdba5babb1677bd32bfd29cac139d10aa9c96fb673"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "10",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "At wave_end a voice whose loop bit is clear sets key off, clears busy and zeroes the sample.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "88",
       "sha": "4e72b274fee8b9f630cfeac277b4bb245c4b93f0b67572c7e9ea880c4613978f"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c352.cpp",
       "lines": "95-105",
       "sha": "a0db2ef70640c943ebdb8e1d66e641d4fdbd7bcb2547638a8b42242a92135edb"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "11",
     "on": "when",
